    {"t": "out", "s": "Key for minion master-node1 accepted."},
    {"t": "out", "s": "Key for minion minion-node2 accepted."},
    {"t": "note", "s": "一次性接受全部待认证 Minion，公钥互换后即可远程执行"}
  ]
